WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.803
Your home screen: today's focus, streak and what to do next.

00:00:05.903 --> 00:00:11.806
Join your library by typing the Library ID from the desk.

00:00:11.906 --> 00:00:17.812
See your seat, shift, plan and when your membership ends.

00:00:17.912 --> 00:00:23.817
Punch in with one tap, from inside the library only.

00:00:23.917 --> 00:00:29.828
Start a focus session. Time is counted on the server, and you earn XP.

00:00:29.928 --> 00:00:35.841
Daily quests give you small goals that keep your streak going.

00:00:35.941 --> 00:00:41.845
Prepare for your exam with a syllabus, mock tests and revision.

00:00:41.945 --> 00:00:47.848
Manage your sign-in and security settings here.
